81nzsJ6ecY2WRgg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "小小书童", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "阅读，投资", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-100", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 100}}}, {"content": "金油比的历史中枢通常在 15-25 之间\n参考历史数据：\n1983年以来，金油比的长期均值约为 18。\n当金油比突破 25 的阈值时，历史上多次伴随经济危机（如1998年亚洲金融危机、2008年次贷危机、2020年疫情冲击）。\n截至2025年7月，金油比已升至 49.81（黄金3314.8美元/盎司，原油66.55美元/桶），远高于历史均值，说明市场对全球经济的悲观预期（衰退风险、地缘冲突）和黄金的过度追捧。需要警惕黄金高位回调风险，同时关注原油供应过剩下的长期价格中枢下移趋势。", "reviewId": "21439435_7ZhgbRNPL", "commentId": "21439435_7ZhgbRNPL_c17139892_81ABMoLog", "userVid": 17139892, "createTime": 1752321880, "likesCount": 4, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 17139892, "name": "🐳空白", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/hNWCQ9bibbzGwmx2pVUianIED6Zwibk51yk6F5N1gN0OWnvtnYGOaQgEta6yGveVxhVyLarFrjCg4w/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "🐳空白", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}}, {"content": "同问", "reviewId": "21439435_7ZhgbRNPL", "commentId": "21439435_7ZhgbRNPL_c231301956_7ZCtTkiL7", "userVid": 231301956, "createTime": 1745385024, "author": {"userVid": 231301956, "name": "气清若兰", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Szib8ySqErWJLdOYekxBy7ibpqjz411Kjhic3ibdAWRQfuFcsNZcnWxJUCiaVX9fcplBSsTFvpDd0icKU/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1779521106}